WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.100
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and I know it’s
only Friday but I’m posting a new Game of

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.200
Thrones video just because I’m going to
be doing more Walking Dead on Sundays.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.019
So I think Thursdays or Fridays will be my
new Game of Thrones Bonus video day.

00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:15.580
More details on schedule updates at the end
of the video.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.220
This is just going to be a fun TAG Game I
found.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.810
So I’ll tag a couple of you guys when I’m
done.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.869
Starting with Question 1: Favorite One-Off
Episode From any Season?

00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:30.230
Just picking one episode I’d say Red Wedding,
I think it still beats the Purple Wedding

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.610
along with Blackwater in terms of moments
of shock and awe.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:37.390
At the time it aired, I knew what the story
was, I’d read Book 3, but it had been so

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.880
long I wasn’t really thinking about it that
much.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.520
And I had only just started making videos.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.370
So I wasn’t quite as dialed in to the day
to day spoilers and news of the show.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.470
So even right up to the episode I wasn’t
really thinking Red Wedding.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.620
They even titled it Rains of Castamere, so
unless you were really thinking hard about

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.620
it.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.559
You wouldn’t have been thinking everyone
is going to die.

00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:01.760
But the way the whole episode came together
in terms of pacing, the set design and oh

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.370
god the music.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:07.860
It was, in my mind, the most perfect moment
of television that year.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:08.980
Of any show or any big event.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:12.901
By the time Season 4 rolled around, I was
so dialed into the behind the scenes stuff

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:15.240
that there were very few surprises.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:19.810
The White Walker scene in Episode 4 was really
the only big big surprise.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.530
Question 2: Favorite Villain?

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:29.910
Technically there are no villains, but right
now definitely the Mountain.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:34.010
The books give you some background as to possible
reasons he might be such a mean person, but

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:38.730
on the show, they very clearly paint him as
a monster.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:43.090
Squishing a beloved character’s head like
a grape will rocket you to the top of the

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.280
villain list.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.260
Question 3: Least Favorite Main Character?

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:55.030
I’d say Shae, she wasn’t a main character
in the books and there was a reason for that.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.630
The show tried to turn her into something
more but I felt like Peter Dinklage could

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:00.600
have just talked to himself and it would have
been more enjoyable.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:04.260
I think part of the reason they jumped her
up from guest cast to main cast was because

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.600
they gave so much more screen time to Tyrion
and they needed to paint him as sympathetic.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.470
I don’t think they needed all the Shae scenes
to do that.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.069
Peter Dinklage is amazing all by himself.

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:19.800
But either way, that little issue cleared
itself up as of the finale.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.420
Question 4: Favorite Sidekick?

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.920
This is easy, always Podrick.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:33.010
He’s also a character that’s gotten more
time on the show that he didn’t get in the

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.010
books.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.690
I’m totally loving the Brienne Podrick scenes
so far.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:40.030
I like them together more as a pair than when
Podrick was with Tyrion.

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.810
They just work better together.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:47.580
Both characters want nothing more than to
become knights.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.910
Just to be clear though, I don’t ship them
or anything like that.

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:52.530
He’s merely there for comedic value.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:56.849
That’s why we didn’t really see him during
the big fight with the hound.

00:02:56.849 --> 00:03:00.260
Question 5: Character You Love To Hate?

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.239
The one person I really ENJOY hating is Ramsay
Bolton.

00:03:03.239 --> 00:03:07.860
He’s written that way but the actor who
plays him takes it to this crazy place where

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:10.200
you do have fun wanting him to die horribly.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:15.950
Before we met him it would have be Joffrey
of course, but after a while hating joffrey

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:22.470
became less of a self-aware fun thing to do
and more of a please make him go away now,

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.470
kind of thing.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.610
I feel like we get just the right amount of
Ramsay, I think that was part of my problem

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.010
with Joffrey after a while.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:31.720
If he’s being forced down your throats by
the camera it’s a lot harder to enjoy him.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.520
All things in moderation, even torturing Theon.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.090
Question 6: Favorite Friendship?

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:43.220
My favorite one that’s not an implied romance
is Jon and Samwell.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:46.480
I’m sure there’s a tumblr ship out there.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:52.590
But they feel like they have a very familiar
camraderie and they both completely understand

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.410
what their relationship is all about.

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.129
Help each other survive.

00:03:56.129 --> 00:04:01.080
Brienne and Jaime would normally be my answer,
but their relationship isn’t as much about

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.500
friendship as it is romance.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.190
So I’m just focusing on true friends.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:07.720
Although that being said, you could say the
Starks and their direwolves.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.640
So many of them have been separated though.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.540
So Jonwell or Direwolves.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:19.799
Question 7: Friendship that never felt Real
to You?

00:04:19.799 --> 00:04:21.949
Any friendship Littefinger was ever a part
of.

00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:25.339
He is the one person I feel like has no friends.

00:04:25.339 --> 00:04:30.759
I really think inside him somewhere, he understands
that everyone is just a piece on a gameboard

00:04:30.759 --> 00:04:32.259
for him to move around.

00:04:32.259 --> 00:04:37.159
The books spell out his feelings for Catelyn
a little more specifically.

00:04:37.159 --> 00:04:44.770
I do believe that he loved her, but where
he is in the story right now, he’s completely

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:45.839
twisted that.

00:04:45.839 --> 00:04:51.039
If not for Ramsay Bolton, he would probably
be one of the most evil people on the show.

00:04:51.039 --> 00:04:56.199
Just for the emotional crimes he commits,
to say nothing of the actual crimes he commits.

00:04:56.199 --> 00:05:02.729
If he had his way, everything would just crumble
to dust and he’d laugh because everyone’s

00:05:02.729 --> 00:05:06.969
toys would be broken.

00:05:06.969 --> 00:05:11.069
Question 8: Favorite Wise-Guy/Joke Teller?

00:05:11.069 --> 00:05:19.300
Easily Tyrion, Bronn tells a lot of jokes,
but Tyrion has this nervous laugh that actually

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.729
makes him funnier.

00:05:20.729 --> 00:05:21.979
Even when he’s not trying to be funny.

00:05:21.979 --> 00:05:25.330
It’s like, “I’m not laughing because
I think my own jokes are funny.”

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:36.919
“I’m laughing because I’m nervous someone
will kill me at any moment.”

00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:39.490
Question 9: Least Favorite Villain?

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:43.689
Littlefinger, he’s clearly a villain, even
if he’s usually not the most vicious one

00:05:43.689 --> 00:05:46.539
like the Mountain.

00:05:46.539 --> 00:05:50.479
I think I’d have more fun with the character
if Aiden Gillen didn’t do the batman voice

00:05:50.479 --> 00:05:51.479
all the time.

00:05:51.479 --> 00:05:56.409
I get it, Littlefinger is oily in a mustache
twirling kind of way.

00:05:56.409 --> 00:06:01.569
But he could still speak in normal voice and
it would be just as creepy.

00:06:01.569 --> 00:06:06.169
This is just a show thing, in the books, I
control the way he sounds just using my imagination.

00:06:06.169 --> 00:06:14.689
The show takes that choice away from you.

00:06:14.689 --> 00:06:18.199
Question 10: Least Favorite Season Long Storyline?

00:06:18.199 --> 00:06:26.659
I hate to say it but Bran did kind of get
dropped.

00:06:26.659 --> 00:06:31.360
He has a remarkable storyline, but because
it didn’t involve face squashing or naked

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.339
whores they show didn’t really do much with
it.

00:06:34.339 --> 00:06:39.050
Bran’s journey adds this nice mystical dimension
to song of ice and fire that gives you a different

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:41.559
perspective than what you get from Melisandre.

00:06:41.559 --> 00:06:44.379
Hopefully Season 5 will bring that out a little.

00:06:44.379 --> 00:06:47.990
I saw that the girl who played the child of
the forest was listed as being in Episode

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:51.939
1 of Season 5, so presumably they’ll follow
up on what happened in the finale.

00:06:51.939 --> 00:06:59.629
Question 11: Talk about a character with a
bad story or character arc?

00:06:59.629 --> 00:07:04.409
I’m a pretty loyal Martin fan, so technically
I don’t think there are any bad character

00:07:04.409 --> 00:07:05.409
arcs.

00:07:05.409 --> 00:07:08.270
This video is mostly show related, so if I
had to pick I’d say Shae.

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:12.429
The way her character ended made her seem
like such a piece of trash.

00:07:12.429 --> 00:07:16.129
If she was supposed to be a big main character,
Martin would have written her to be a little

00:07:16.129 --> 00:07:19.669
more aware of Tyrion’s reasons for pushing
her away.

00:07:19.669 --> 00:07:23.059
She was supposed to be clever, but if she
was clever why wouldn’t she just wait things

00:07:23.059 --> 00:07:26.439
out for a few years overseas till Tyrion could
bring her back.

00:07:26.439 --> 00:07:31.379
A Song of Ice and Fire is all about the LONG
con, it’s not a short term game.

00:07:31.379 --> 00:07:36.550
Question 12: Character that pisses you off
no matter how much you try to like them?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.550
Samwell definitely.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.889
He’s written that way though.

00:07:38.889 --> 00:07:41.080
He’s like the Lisa Simpson of the story.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:45.330
He’ll probably gain all the knowledge they
need to defeat the white walkers, but because

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.440
he’s such a fool.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.099
No one will listen to him.

00:07:48.099 --> 00:07:55.639
Jon listens to him, but that only goes so
far.

00:07:55.639 --> 00:07:57.300
Jon can’t do everything by himself.

00:07:57.300 --> 00:08:02.189
The other brothers of the Night’s Watch
also have to have faith in Samwell and I don’t

00:08:02.189 --> 00:08:04.050
think they take him seriously yet.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:09.789
I’m really interested to see how closely
Samwell’s arc stays to the books in season

00:08:09.789 --> 00:08:10.789
5.

00:08:10.789 --> 00:08:15.490
Question 13: Plot Device That Gets Used To
Much?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:19.209
Definitely using whorehouse sex scenes to
convey exposition.

00:08:19.209 --> 00:08:25.449
People started calling it sexposition, Game
of Thrones was the show that started that

00:08:25.449 --> 00:08:26.849
back in Season 1 or 2 I think.

00:08:26.849 --> 00:08:34.820
They haven’t done it as much since Littlefinger
left his whorehouse at King’s Landing, but

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.400
every new episode I always wonder when the
big explainer scene is coming and who’s

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.560
going to be having the sex while they explain
something.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:45.110
That would make a great EDU Sex ed youtube
channel.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.110
Sexpositions.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:47.310
I’ll book mark that for later.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.740
Question 14: Favorite Character Death Scene?

00:08:50.740 --> 00:09:00.470
Definitely Oberyn Martell, when Joffrey Died
all I could think was thank god it’s finally

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.470
over.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.500
Oberyn’s character arc was so much more
interesting and it didn’t drag on for too

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:06.520
many seasons.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:13.930
It also helped that it came after one of the
most exquisite fight scenes the show has ever

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:14.930
done.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:21.900
and last one, Question 15: Abandoned or Unanswered
Plot Line That will always Bug You?

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.350
Until we hear otherwise, this is always going
to be Gendry.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:29.780
As of now he’s still rowing his way from
Dragonstone to King’s Landing.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.300
There are any number of directions they can
take the character.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:37.180
I know a lot of you want him to meet up with
Arya again.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:43.940
I won’t say what happens in the books, but
if you have read please use spoiler tags in

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.370
terms of what’s going on with her in season
5.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:49.610
Of all the characters in season 5, I feel
like Arya’s will be one of the arcs that

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.350
stays closer to the books.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:54.140
Book 4 specifically if you guys want to read
ahead.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:10:02.830
So I have to tag a few people, I’ll tag
KaosDevice, DrakeVagabond, Rag Princess Sews

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.320
and simply maya beauty.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.870
It’s okay if you guys can’t make videos,
just do a tumblr post and tweet the link out

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:12.680
with my name in it so it shows up in my mentions
on twitter.

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:17.460
I’m also creating a poll for our first re-watch
episode, once we find an episode and a time

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:20.790
everyone can watch it, we’ll give it a try.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.220
Links for everything in the description.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:30.800
You can click here to learn more about some
of 

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:36.910
the season 5 characters and click here to
learn about my fall schedule and all the shows

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:40.580
and movies and stuff I’m doing videos for.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.740
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.480
High Fives!

